OL,3,GNEWSAStone unveiled for Mobo founder
OL,4,AKanya King
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusic artist Emelie Sande and MP Dawn
OL,7,FButler have unveiled a commemorative
OL,8,Fstone honouring Mobo founder Kanya King
OL,9,Fin north-west London.
OL,11,FThe stone, engraved with Paving the
OL,12,FWay, was installed at King's former
OL,13,Fschool, Queens Park Community School.
OL,15,FCelebrating black music, culture and
OL,16,Fexcellence, the first awards were held
OL,17,Fin 1996.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
