OL,3,GNEWSAStone unveiled for Mobo founder
OL,4,AKanya King
OL,5,
OL,6,FSande told BBC London: "My first time
OL,7,Fperforming live on TV was at the Mobos.
OL,8,FBut Kanya took a risk on me and she
OL,9,Fsaid, you know, we see your talent, we
OL,10,Fwant you to be seen."
